  "instance_name": "thank_you_for_service_cultural_phenomenon",
  "label": "Thank You for Service Cultural Phenomenon",
  "description": "A widespread cultural expression of gratitude and recognition for individuals who serve in the military, law enforcement, or other public service roles, especially those who perform dangerous or high-stress duties. This phrase is often used in public discourse, media, and memorials to honor service members. In the context of this meme, it is used to acknowledge the sacrifices and risks taken by bomb disposal experts, though the visual metaphor may unintentionally romanticize or spiritualize their experience.",
